---
layout: "layouts/site.njk"
title: "About"
description: "Tifa Jade is a director, producer and content strategist. From backyard movies in Richland to UFC, BoomTV and Good Loser, here's the story so far."
permalink: "/about/"
---
{%- set cdn = "https://tifajade.b-cdn.net/About%20Me/" -%}
<section class="section about-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="label" data-reveal>About</p>
    <h1 class="display" data-split>I'm Tifa Jade, but you can call me <span class="flourish">TJ.</span></h1>
    <p class="lede" data-reveal>Ten chapters, from backyard movies to directing for some of the biggest names in sports and gaming. Scroll to read the story.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section about" data-about-story>
  <div class="container about-story">
    <div class="about-story__media" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="frame">
        {%- for ch in about %}
        {#- Nothing loads until a chapter is on screen; the script starts each loop -#}
        <video muted loop playsinline preload="none" data-chapter-video="{{ loop.index0 }}"{% if loop.first %} class="is-active"{% endif %}>
          <source src="{{ cdn }}{{ ch.video }}.webm" type="video/webm" />
          <source src="{{ cdn }}{{ ch.video }}_h264_preview.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="about-counter label"><span data-chapter-current>01</span> / {{ about.length | pad2 }}</p>
    </div>

    <ol class="about-story__chapters" role="list">
      {%- for ch in about %}
      <li class="chapter{% if loop.last %} chapter--last{% endif %}" data-chapter="{{ loop.index0 }}">
        <div class="frame frame--portrait chapter__media" aria-hidden="true">
          <video muted loop playsinline preload="none">
            <source src="{{ cdn }}{{ ch.video }}.webm" type="video/webm" />
            <source src="{{ cdn }}{{ ch.video }}_h264_preview.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
        </div>
        <p class="label chapter__place" data-reveal>{{ loop.index | pad2 }} · {{ ch.place }}</p>
        <h2 class="chapter__title" data-split>{{ ch.title }}</h2>
        <div class="prose" data-reveal><p>{{ ch.copy | safe }}</p></div>
        {%- if loop.last %}
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--primary btn--large" data-reveal>Let's talk</a>
        {%- endif %}
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
